<SAMI>
<Head>
   <Title>Weather Report for Tuesday</Title>
   <SAMIParam>
      Copyright {(C)Copyright 2026, Example Weather Desk}
      Media {weather.wav}
      Metrics {time:ms; duration: 73000;}
      Spec {MSFT:1.0;}
   </SAMIParam>

   <STYLE TYPE="text/css"><!--
      P {margin-left: 29pt; margin-right: 29pt; font-size: 12pt; 
      text-align: left; font-family: tahoma, arial, sans-serif; 
      font-weight: normal; color: white; background-color: black;}

      TABLE {Width: "248pt" ;}

      .ENUSCC {Name: "English Captions"; lang: en-US-CC;}

#Source {margin-bottom: -15pt; background-color: silver; 
         color: black; vertical-align: normal; font-size: 12pt; 
         font-family: tahoma, arial, sans-serif; 
         font-weight: normal;}

#Youth {color: greenyellow; font-size: 18pt;}

#BigPrint-1 {color: yellow; font-size: 24pt;}-->
   </Style>
</Head>

<Body>
   <SYNC Start=0>
      <P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>Weather Desk   
   <SYNC Start=10>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>Good morning, here is the weather 
         for the coast and the hills 
         over the next two days.
   <SYNC Start=8800>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>The morning starts cool and grey, 
         with light rain near the harbour,
   <SYNC Start=19500>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>and the rain moves inland before noon, 
         so take an umbrella to the station.
   <SYNC Start=28000>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>In the afternoon the clouds break up
          and the wind turns to the west.
   <SYNC Start=38000>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>Tomorrow brings sun for most of the day, 
         with fifteen degrees on the coast.
   <SYNC Start=46000>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>The hills stay a little colder, 
         about ten degrees at noon, 
         and the night is clear and calm.
   <SYNC Start=61000>
      <P Class=ENUSCC>The trains and the ferries run on time, 
         and the market by the river 
         opens at eight as usual.
   <SYNC Start=73000>
      <P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>End of:
      <P Class=ENUSCC>Weather Report for Tuesday
</Body>
</SAMI>
